---
description: Inspect Tamil scalars and normalization, not rendered glyphs.
alwaysApply: true
---

Never trust visual Tamil glyph inspection. Use mcp-tamil-oracle tools or explicit
hex escapes. NFC is required unless a golden value has an exact, reasoned Unicode
exception. Keep golden JSONL escaped; canonical `lexicon/*.toml` tables use
readable NFC UTF-8 Tamil with detached Tamil marks, Braille, Tamil Supplement,
and control/special characters escaped (`tools/toml_utf8.py`). Never silently
delete ZWJ/ZWNJ or change intentionally decomposed tests. Run `just check-unicode`
after edits.
